# Test binaries and profiles
*.test
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# Materialised corpus scales that are pinned by MANIFEST.sha256 but not stored.
# See the README: regenerating all three takes about 1.5 seconds, so committing
# 12.7 MB and ~250 MB to save that is a bad trade. small.json *is* committed and
# must not be ignored.
corpusdata/data/medium.json
corpusdata/data/large.json
plans/

# Tool binaries fetched by tools/*.sh.
tools/bin/

# Downloaded datasets: scripts and checksums are committed, the data is not.
datasets/data/
